Below are the generations of Noah , who was a righteous man and a perfect man in his generation , and he accompanied God
And Noah begat three sons , Shim , and Hin , and Japh ,
The world is destroyed before God . The earth is full of violence .
The way of God sees the world is desolate ; and every bloody man is desolate in his deeds on earth .
And God said unto Noah , The end of every bloodthirsty man is come unto me , because the earth is full of their violence , and I will destroy them and the earth together .
And thou shalt make a ark of acacia wood , divided in pieces , and sprinkle with pine on the outside .
&quot; This is how the ark was made : it shall be three hundred cubits long , fifty cubits wide , and thirty cubits high .
&quot; The upper side of the ark shall be an elbow high , and the doors of the ark shall be opened by the side , and the ark shall be divided into three layers , the upper , the middle , and the lower .
&quot; Behold , I will cause a flood to overflow the earth , and I will destroy the earth , and every living thing on the earth that has blood and flesh and breath will not die .
&quot; But I will make a covenant with you , that you and your wife , and your sons and your daughters , will enter into the ark
&quot; You shall bring into the ark every living thing of blood and flesh , two of them , one male and one female , so that you may live in it .
The birds are of their kind , and the livestock are of their kind , and the insects of the earth are of their kind , two of them each ; they shall come unto thee for the sake of life .
&quot; You shall store up all kinds of food for yourselves and for their food .
So Noah did ; and he did according to all that God commanded him .
&quot; The Lord said to Noah , &quot; Enter the ark , you and all your household ; for in this generation I have seen that you are righteous before me
&quot; You shall take seven males and seven females of every clean animal ; and you shall take one male and one female of every unclean animal .
And the birds of the air shall bear seven males and seven females , and they shall dwell on all the earth .
&quot; For in seven days I will rain on the earth forty days , day and night , and destroy all the living creatures that I have created from the earth .
And Noah did according to the commandment of the Lord
Noah lived six hundred years when the floods overflowed the earth .
And Noah went into the ark with his wife , and with his sons and his daughters , to escape from the flood
The pure beasts , and the unclean beasts , and the birds , and all the insects of the earth
