The waters were great , and the land was great , and the boats were floating on the waters .
The waters were exceedingly great on the earth , and all the high mountains of the earth were drowned
The water was more than fifteen cubits high , and the mountains were all drowned
All the beasts that have flesh and blood on the earth , the birds , the beasts , the beasts of the field , and the insects that creep on the earth , and all the people , are dead
