And Noah built an altar for the Lord , and took every clean beast , and every bird that flew , and offered it for a burnt offering
And the LORD heard the scent of it , and said in his heart , &quot; I will no longer curse for man &apos;s sake , and no more do I according to what I have commanded ; I will destroy all the living creatures .
When the earth remains , the harvest , the heat , the winter , the summer , the day and night , will never cease .
God blessed Noah and his sons , and said to them , &quot; You will raise up many people and fill the earth
