&quot; You shall give me the barley hole on the top of the field , and he shall sell it to me at an adequate price , and I shall be buried among you .
And it came to pass , as Ephraim sat in the midst of the Hittites , that the Hittites spoke to Abraham before Ephraim the Hittite , who was at the gate of the city .
&quot; Behold , my Lord , I will give you this field , and the hole in the field , and I will give it to you in the presence of my people , that they may bury your dead
