And he said unto Ephraim before them , If thou wilt hear me , I will give thee the price of the field , and I will bury my dead in it .
Ephraim answered Abraham , saying ,
&quot; Listen , my Lord , what is the value of a field of four hundred shekels of silver between you and me ? Let your dead be buried .
And Abraham listened to Ephraim , and according to all that he had said in the presence of the Hittites , he gave Ephraim four hundred shekels of silver for the sale of the common silver .
