So he hurried , and poured the water of the bottle into the tank , and ran to the well , and poured water for all the camels .
And the man looked on him , and said not a word , lest he should know that there was no way that the Lord had given him .
When the camel had finished drinking , he took a golden ring , half a shekel , and two bracelets , and ten shekels , and gave them to the woman
Then said he , &quot; Tell me , whose daughter are you ? Is there a place for us to lodge in your father &apos;s house ? &quot;
And the woman said , I am the daughter of Pethor , the son of Micah and the son of Nahor .
And said , &quot; In our house is plenty of food and grass , and a place to lodge .
Then he humbled himself before the Lord
&quot; Blessed is the Lord , the God of my master Abraham , who has been merciful and faithful to my master . As for me , the Lord has guided me on the way to the house of my master &apos;s brothers
Then the woman ran back and told his mother and his family according to these words
