&quot; If he says , &apos; You only drink , &apos; I will also water your camels ; let the woman be the wife that the Lord has appointed for my master &apos;s son
And it came to pass , when the words of my heart had not yet been finished , that Libah came out , and took a bottle of water on his shoulder , and went down to the well , and poured it out ; and I said unto him , Give me water , and drink it
So he quickly took the bottle from his shoulder , and said , &quot; Please drink ; I will also drink for your camels ; and I will drink ; and he will drink for my camels
And I said unto him , Whose daughter art thou ? And he said , I am the daughter of Micah , and of Pethor the son of the Crane ; and I put the ring upon his nose , and the bracelet upon his two hands
Then I humbled myself before the LORD , and praised the LORD God of my master Abraham , for he had guided me in the way of righteousness , and given me the daughters of my master &apos;s brother , and gave me the son of my master as wife .
