And there he built an altar , and prayed in the name of the Lord , and set up a tent ; and his servant dug a well therein .
Abimelech , and Ahuzzar his friend , and Phinehas the captain of his army , came from Gilead unto Esau
And he said unto them , Why come ye to me , when ye have hated me , and sent me away ?
