Blessed are you in the Lord , that you do not harm us , as we have not harmed you , and that you are kind to us , and that you walk in peace and security ;
And he prepared a feast for them , and they ate and drank
And they swore unto each other early in the morning ; and when he sent them away , they departed from him in peace .
Then came the servant of Esau that day , and told him about the well , saying , &quot; We have received water .
And he called the name of the well Shiba : and the city was called Unto this day Shiba .
