Then he went and brought it , and gave it to his mother , and her mother made it delicious , as her father loved it .
And Rebekah cleansed the good clothes of the great son that was in the house , and put them on Jacob his younger son
And of lamb &apos;s skin , wrapped in the hand of Jacob , and in the smooth place of his neck ,
