Jacob came to his father and said , &quot; My father , &quot; and he said , &quot; Who are you , my son , that I am here
Then Jacob said to his father , &quot; I am your eldest son , Esau ; I have done what you have commanded me : Arise , sit down , eat my meat , and bless me
