Moses did not eat nor drink water in the Lord &apos;s presence forty days and forty nights ; and the word of the covenant which the Lord wrote was ten commandments in two volumes
Moses had two copies of the Law in his hand , and he did not know his skin in the time of Mount Sinai ; for the word of the Lord and His word was made clear
