&quot; Then he shall bring his wife to the priest , and he shall offer him one tenth of an ephah of wheat flour with him ; no oil shall be poured on it , nor any spices shall be added to it ; for it is a suspicious offering , a memorial , a memorial to sin
&quot; The priest shall bring the woman near and stand before the Lord
&quot; The priest shall pour the holy water into the pot , and take dust from the earth of the tabernacle , and put it in the water
