And let the woman swear to him , and say unto him , If there is not a man who prostituteth with thee , and hath not done that which is unclean unto thy husband , then thou shalt be delivered from the curse of the waters .
&quot; If you turn your backs on your husband and do unclean things , there will be others who will have sex with you besides your husband .
May the Lord make your thighs thin and your abdomen swollen , and that you may be cursed among your people as an oath
