The Lord spoke to Moses , saying ,
&quot; You shall divide the land according to the number of the names of the people , and give it to them for your service .
Thou shalt divide the inheritance among the many , and the few among the few ; thou shalt divide the inheritance among the few ; according to the number of the numbered shalt thou divide it among the people .
Even so , they shall divide the land in lots ; and they shall inherit it according to the names of the tribes of their fathers .
&quot; You shall divide the inheritance among them according to the number of the lot , and according to the number of the people , and according to the number of the people
