And for the bulls , and for the lambs , and for the lambs , a sacrifice of the firstfruits , and a drink offering of the firstfruits , according to the number ;
And one goat for a sin offering , beside the continual burnt offering , and the same meat offering , and the same drink offering ;
&quot; These sacrifices shall be offered to the Lord in your feasts , in addition to what you have promised and willingly offered , as your burnt offerings , as your meal offerings , as your drinking offerings , as your peace offerings
Moses told the children of Israel all that the Lord had commanded him
Moses spoke to the heads of the tribes of Israel , saying , &quot; This is what the Lord has commanded
&quot; If a man swears to the Lord or swears to be obedient to himself , he shall not eat , nor do anything according to all that is spoken in his mouth .
&quot; When a woman is young and is in her father &apos;s house , if she swears to the Lord to be obedient ,
And when his father heard his promises , and bound his words , he did not speak to him in silence ; but his promises , and bound his words , were determined
&quot; But the days that his father hears shall not be determined if he does not obey his promises and his words , and the Lord will forgive him , because his father did not obey
If he marries , or if he wishes to marry , or if he wishes to marry , or if he wishes to marry , or if he wishes to marry , or if he wishes to marry , or if he wishes to marry , he will marry .
&quot; The days when his husband hears , but does not speak to him silently , and his promises are made , and his words are bound ,
But in the days when his husband hears , and if he is unwilling , and if he forsakes his vows and his transgressions , which he hath committed , the Lord will forgive him .
