&quot; He who repays blood will commit suicide to the murderer , and he will kill him when he meets him .
If a man pushes a man down by resentment , or casts a thing into his bosom , he shall die .
Or he that smiteth with his hand for the sake of hatred shall die ; and he that smiteth shall be put to death ; and he that smiteth shall surely be put to death ; and he that smiteth shall surely be put to death ; and he that bringeth vengeance shall surely be put to death , when he meeteth him .
&quot; If a man has no hatred , he will suddenly push him down , or if he is not buried , he will throw things on him
