&quot; You shall listen and examine and make a thorough examination . Indeed , it is true , and this abomination will be done among you .
Thou shalt slay with the sword the inhabitants of that city , and slay with the sword all that is in it , even the livestock .
&quot; You shall pile up all that you have taken out of that city on the streets , and burn it with fire , and all that you have taken out of it , before the Lord your God ; and it will be a desolation forever , and you will not build it again .
&quot; That which is destroyed shall not stick to your hand at all . Listen to the word of the Lord your God , and keep all the commandments which I command you today , and do that which is right in the eyes of the Lord your God ; and the Lord will not turn his anger , but will be kind to you , and will have mercy on you , as He swore to your fathers , and will multiply you .
