&quot; You are the children of the LORD your God ; you shall not cut off the dead with the sword , nor shave your foreheads .
&quot; Because you belong to the Lord your God , the holy people ; and the Lord has chosen you from among all the people of the earth for his own people
And all abominable things shall not be eaten
&quot; The livestock that can be eaten are cattle , sheep , and goats
Deer , antelopes , ostriches , wild goats , elk , yellow goats , blue goats
&quot; You shall eat every beast whose hoofs are divided into two halves and which chews .
&quot; But the camel , and the rabbit , and the locust , which are not eaten in the chewing or in the splitting of the feet , are unclean to you because they do not split the feet .
&quot; The pigs are unclean to you because of their hoofs , and they do not chew ; and you shall not eat the flesh of them , nor touch the dead .
These are the things that can be eaten in the waters ; and they that have wings and scales can be eaten
&quot; No one without wings and without scales shall eat ; it is not clean with you .
&quot; You shall eat every clean bird .
&quot; What is not to be eaten is a carving , a carving of a dog &apos;s head , a carving of a red head .
Owl , owl , owl , and their kinds
Crows and their kinds
