lest they teach you all the abominations which they have done to their God , so that you may sin against the Lord your God
&quot; If you encircle a city for a long time and attack it , you will not be able to cut down trees with an axe , for you will not be able to eat the fruit of that tree . Are the trees of the field man-made to destroy you ?
