&quot; You shall leave your mother , and take only your offspring ; and you will be blessed , and your days will be long .
&quot; If you build a house , you shall have a fence around it , so that no one will fall from it , and bloody sins will be in your house .
&quot; You shall not sow two kinds of seed in your vineyard , lest the fruit that you sow and the fruit of the vineyard become fruitful .
No cow and donkey farming
&quot; You shall not wear clothes made of two mixtures of wool and fine linen .
And thou shalt encircle the garments of thy garments as an eagle round about .
If a man marries a wife , then he hates her after being in her house .
The mouth of the letter said to him , &quot; I have married this woman with him in the same house , and I see that he has no proof of chastity . &quot;
And the parents of the woman shall bring forth the testimony of her virginity , and bring it to the elders of the gates of the city .
The father of the woman shall say to the elders , &quot; I have given my daughter to this man as wife , and he hates him
And the mouth of the letter said unto him , I have seen that thy daughters have no proof of chastity ; but this is the proof of my daughter &apos;s chastity ; and they laid the cloth before the elders of this city .
The elders of this city shall take him and punish him
And he shall punish him with a hundred shekels of silver for the father of a woman , because he hath put a shameful name upon a woman in Israel , and she shall be his wife , and he shall not be restless for ever .
But if this be true , then women have no proof of chastity
&quot; You shall bring a woman to the door of her father &apos;s house ; and the men of this city shall stone her to death , because she has committed adultery in her father &apos;s house , and has done abominations in Israel ; and you shall remove the evil from among you .
&quot; If a man meets a woman who has a husband and commits adultery , he shall put the adulteress and the adulteress to death together , and remove the evil from Israel .
