Then Jonathan said , &quot; We will pass over to those who are there , and let them see us .
&quot; If they say to us , &apos; Stand up , &apos; and wait for us to go to you , we will stand up and not go to them
&quot; If they say , &apos; Come up to us , &apos; this is our testimony , &apos; we will go up ; for the Lord has given them into our hands .
Then the two men saw the Philistines , and the Philistines said , &quot; The Hebrews have come out of the hidden cave .
Then the defenders said to Jonathan and to the men of the armor , &quot; Come up here , and we have a commandment for you . Jonathan said to the men of the armor , &quot; Follow me up , for the Lord has delivered them into the hand of Israel
And Jonathan went up , and the men of the armor followed him : and Jonathan slew the Philistines , and the men of the armor also with them .
And Jonathan and the men of the host , whom they slew at the beginning , were twenty men , all in the half ditch of one acre .
