And Saul said , &quot; I am guilty ; yet lift me up before the elders of my people and before the children of Israel , and come back with me , that I may worship the Lord your God
Then Samuel turned and went back with Saul , and Saul worshipped the Lord
Then said Samuel , &quot; Bring to me Ahab king of Amali , &quot; and Ahab came to him joyfully , saying in his heart , &quot; The pain of death is surely passed away .
