Then David said , &quot; The men of Gilead will not give me and those who are with me into the hand of Saul , &quot; but the Lord said , &quot; It will come out
And David and about six hundred men that were with him went up out of Kiir to the place where they could go : and there was a man that accused Saul , and David fled from Kiir ; and Saul came not out .
