&quot; O my father , look at the collar of your robe in my hand . I have cut off your collar and have not killed you , so that you may know that I have not rebelled against you with malice ; and though you have taken my life , I have not sinned against you .
&quot; May the Lord judge between me and you , and redress me for you , and I will not hurt you with my own hands
