And he commanded the captains of hundreds , and the Chaldeans , and the guards , and all the people of the land , to come down from the house of the LORD , and to enter into the king &apos;s house by the gate of the guards ; and he sat in the throne .
All the people rejoiced , and the palace was quiet ; and all the people struck Ahaziah with the sword in the king &apos;s palace
When Jehoash ascended , seven years old
