And it came to pass , when Amaziah slept with his fathers , that Azariah took Elah , and returned to Judah , and repaired it again .
And Amaziah the son of Joash king of Judah reigned fifteen years , and Jeroboam the son of Joash king of Israel reigned forty years in Damascus
