Of the tribe of Benjamin , Gaba and her suburbs , and Argon and her suburbs , and Anathoun and her suburbs ; thirteen cities were given to their families .
And the rest of the tribe of Kohath had ten cities in the land of the half tribe of Manasseh .
The children of Gershon , according to their families , had thirteen cities in the land of the tribe of Issachar , in the land of the tribe of Assyria , in the land of the tribe of Naphtali , and in the land of the tribe of Bashan-e-Nasay .
The children of Merari had twelve cities according to their families , in the land of the tribe of Reuben , in the land of the tribe of Gad , and in the land of the tribe of Zebulun .
And the children of Israel gave these cities and their suburbs unto the Levites
