And the sons of Issachar ; Dara , and Puah , and Jahaz , and Shinron , four .
And the sons of Dorah ; Uzziah , and Rephaiah , and Jelah , and Jabah , and Ebershazzar , and Shimei , were the chiefs of the tribe of Dorah ; and they were mighty warriors ; and by the year of David their number was twenty and two thousand six hundred
And the sons of Uzziah were Israh ; and the sons of Israh were Michael , and Obediah , and Joel , and Isiah , five men , chief of the tribe .
And the army which they commanded according to the tribes was thirty-six thousand men , because of the multitude of their wives and their children .
And their brethren were mighty warriors among the tribes of Issachar according to the number of their families , eighty-seven thousand .
And the sons of Benjamin were Beer-sheba , and Beer-sheba , and Jezpeh , three .
And the sons of Beer-sheba were Ishmael , and Uzziah , and Uzziah , and Jeremiah , and Eli , five men ; all of them were princes , and mighty warriors : and according to the genealogy were their sons twenty-two thousand and thirty-four .
And the sons of Bichdon were Shemariah , and Joash , and Eliezer , and Elijon , and Amri , and Jeremiah , and Abijah , and Anathoth , and Aramun : these were the sons of Bichdon
All of them were chiefs and mighty warriors ; according to their genealogy , their children were twenty and two hundred .
And the sons of Jezpeh were Bilhah ; and the sons of Bilhah were Jeush , and Benjamin , and Ehud , and Kenanah , and Shintan , and Hesh , and Ashishah ,
These are the sons of Jeppuh , chiefs of the fathers &apos; households , mighty warriors ; and their sons were able to fight in battle : and they were seventy-two hundred men .
and Shushan the son of Eor , and Shushan the son of Ahaz ,
And the sons of Naphtali : Jasher , and Tuni , and Jezer , and Shalon : these are the sons of Beer-sheba
the son of Manasseh , which was born to his concubine the Aramites , and the father of Gilead , Maghi
And the wife of Maghi was Shushan , the sister of Shushan , whose name was Magah ; and the second son of Manasseh was Cyrophiah ; and Cyrophiah had several daughters .
And Magah his wife bare him a son , whose name was Bilesh ; and the brothers of Bilesh were Shilish , and the sons of Shilish were Uran and Likin .
And the sons of Uran ; Bidan ; and these are the sons of Gilead ; and Gilead was the son of Maghi , and Maghi the son of Manasseh .
And the sons of Gilead , Hamalijah , were born to Ishhor , and to Abiezer , and to Marah .
And the sons of Shemmai were Azan , and Shechem , and Rechi , and Anin .
