And the sons of Hath were Zabbath , and the sons of Zabbath were Shutil : and Ephraim begat Isheh , and Eli : and they were slain by the inhabitants of the land , because they had taken the cattle of the Chaldeans .
And Ephraim , their father , mourned for them many days ; and his brethren comforted him
And Ephraim was with his wife ; and his wife conceived and bore a son ; and Ephraim called his name Beer-sheba because of the evil of his house
And his daughter &apos;s name was Sheila , which was in Bethlehem in the building , and in Bethlehem in the lower , and in Sheila &apos;s envy .
And the sons of Bileah were Rephah , and Rezith ; and the sons of Rezith were Herah , and the sons of Herah were Ham .
And the son of Haman was Ladan ; and the son of Ladan was Amishhud ; and the son of Amishhud was Elishama .
And the sons of Elishama were Neh , and the sons of Neh were Joshua ,
And the land and the dwelling place of the children of Ephraim were Bethlehem and its villages , and Naran on the east side , and Kizr on the west side , and Shechem and its villages , even unto Gaza and its villages .
