the sons of Heman , Jesheh , and Shemei , the sons of Jeduthun , Shemaiah , and Uzziel ,
&quot; They shall come and gather together their brethren , and purify themselves , as the king commanded , and as the Lord commanded , and enter into the house of the Lord , purifying themselves
&quot; The priest shall enter into the house of the Lord , and cleanse the house , and bring all the filth of the house into the house of the Lord ; and the Levites shall take it , and bring it to the side of the river that flows outward .
