Then they spoke to the king of Hezekiah , saying , &quot; We have cleansed the whole house of the Lord , and the burnt offering , and all the vessels of the altar , and the table for the cakes , and all the vessels of the table
&quot; We have prepared and cleansed the vessels which King Ahasuerus had rejected in the time of sin , and are now before the altar of the Lord
And the king of Hezekiah arose early , and gathered together all the princes of the city unto the house of the LORD
And he took seven bulls , and seven rams , and seven lambs , and seven goats , for a sin offering for the kingdom , and for the house , and for the children of Judah ; and the king commanded the priests of Aaron &apos;s sons to offer them on the altar of the Lord
Then he slaughtered the bull , and the priest took the blood and sprinkled it on the altar , and he slaughtered the goat , and sprinkled it on the altar , and the lamb , and sprinkled it on the altar
And he took the goat for a sin offering , and brought it before the king and before the congregation , and they laid their hands on it
&quot; The priest slaughtered the sheep and offered the blood on the altar for a sin offering for all Israel , for the burnt offering and the sin offering which the king commanded to be offered for all Israel
