And Hezekiah commanded to offer a burnt offering on the altar , one burnt offering , and to sing the song of the LORD , and to sing with the trumpets , and to sing with the instruments of David king of Israel
And all the congregation worshipped , and sang , and blew , and blew , until the burnt offering was finished
And when the sacrifice was finished , the king and all those who were with him fell down to worship
