Then said Hezekiah , &quot; Because you are sanctified in the Lord , come and offer your offerings and your thanksgivings in the house of the Lord ; and the congregation will offer their offerings and their thanksgivings ; and whoever is willing and willing will also offer his burnt offering .
The burnt offering of the congregation was as follows : seventy bulls , one hundred sheep , and two hundred lambs : these were the burnt offerings of the Lord
and the holy things , six hundred bulls and three thousand rams
But because the priests were too few to wash the skin of the burnt offering , their brothers , the Levites , helped them , and waited for the burnt offering to be finished , and for other priests to be cleansed , because they were cleaner in their hearts than the priests for the Levites
&quot; There will be much fat for the burnt offering , and for the sacrifice of peace , and for the burnt offering , and for the drink offering ; and all the work in the house of the Lord will be made ready .
The house of Hezekiah and all the people rejoiced at the speed of the work , because God had prepared it for them .
