&quot; You shall not obey your fathers and your brothers , who have sinned against the Lord , the God of their fathers , and the Lord has abandoned them and destroyed them , as you have seen .
&quot; Now do not be as your ancestors were ; but obey the Lord and enter into His holy place , a holy place for ever , and serve the Lord your God , that His wrath may be turned away from you .
&quot; If you turn to the Lord , your brothers and your children , they will have mercy on the people who have taken them captive , and they will be able to return to the land ; for the Lord your God is merciful and merciful ; and if you turn to Him , He will not turn away from you .
