And he said unto them , Thus saith the Lord , the God of Israel ; Ye shall return unto him that sent you unto me , saying ,
Thus saith the Lord ; I will curse the land and all the inhabitants thereof according to all the curses that are written in that book which is before the king of Judah
&quot; For they have forsaken me , and burned incense to other gods , and provoked me to anger because of what they have done with their hands ; so that my wrath will not cease to be as fire on this earth .
