And in Jerusalem was Uzziah the son of Bani , the son of Hashabiah , the son of Mattani , the son of Micah , the son of Asa , the son of the singer , the chief of the Levites , over the affairs of the house of God
&quot; The king has given orders for singing , and every day he will provide them with a certain amount of food .
