Their land is full of idols ; they kneel down to that which their hands have made , that which their fingers have made .
The humble kneel , and the noble kneel down ; so they cannot be forgiven .
&quot; When you enter a cave and hide yourself in the earth , you will avoid the fear of the Lord and His glory .
In that day , the proud eyes will be humbled , and the arrogant will be kneeling down , and the Lord alone will be glorified .
&quot; There will be a day of punishment from the Lord for all the hosts , and it will come to the proud and to the mad , and all the proud will be humbled .
