idols will be completely abolished
&quot; When the Lord rises and shakes the earth , they enter a cave , and a hole in the earth , to escape the terror of the Lord and the glory of His majesty .
&quot; In that day , the gold idols and the silver idols , which men have made for worship , will be thrown to the rats and the bats
&quot; When the Lord is risen and shakes the earth greatly , people will enter into the caves and the pits of rocks to escape the terror of the Lord and the glory of His majesty
&quot; You will rely on the man whose nose has no breath . What is he worth in all things ?
