Fifty chief men and noble men , and counselors and wise men , and magicians
&quot; I will make the little ones their leaders , and the little ones will rule over them , &quot; said the Lord .
The people will be oppressed against each other , and each will be oppressed against his neighbour . The young men will insult the elderly , and the humble will insult the noble .
