Woe to those who call evil for good , good for evil , dark for light , light for dark , pain for sweet , sweet for pain !
Woe to those who think they are wise , and think they are wise !
Woe to those who have the courage to drink , and the ability to refine wine !
They call the wicked righteous because of their corruption , and take away the righteous from them .
