And his kingdom and his peace shall be multiplied without end , and he shall reign in the throne of David , and he shall establish his kingdom in righteousness and in righteousness , from this day even unto the end : and the wrath of the Lord of hosts shall accomplish it .
The word of the LORD came into the house of Jacob , and into the house of Israel
That all the people , even Ephraim and the inhabitants of Samaria , should know , and that they should say with pride :
