&quot; Do I not treat Samaria and the idols thereof as I treat Jerusalem and the idols thereof
&quot; When the Lord accomplished all his work in mount Zion and Jerusalem , He said , &apos; I will punish the proud heart of King Assyria and the glory of his proud eyes
For he said , &quot; What I have accomplished is by the power of my hand , and by my wisdom ; for I have been wise ; I have moved the land of the nations , and taken away the treasures of their livestock ; and I am like a mighty man , and I have made the seats of the throne humble .
