Jacob will grow , and Israel will bloom ; and their fruit will fill the world .
&quot; Is it as if the Lord had struck them as those who struck their people , and they were slain as they were slain ?
&quot; You sent them away to fight with them , and in the days of the east winds you drove them away with the storms .
