He said to them , &quot; You shall give rest to the weary , that he may rest , and that he may be refreshed ; but they do not listen . &quot;
&quot; Therefore the word of the Lord is to them , Command , command , command , command , command , command , here and there , that they may go up and down before them , and fall and fall , and fall and fall , and fall into the net , and be entangled
&quot; Therefore these blasphemers among you are the people of Jerusalem , who rule over them , to hear the word of the Lord .
&quot; You said , &apos; We have made a covenant with death , and a covenant with darkness ; and the enemy will not come to us as waters flow , because we hide behind falsehood as refuge . &apos; 
Therefore thus says the Lord Yahweh : &quot; Behold , I have set a stone in Zion as a foundation , a tested stone , a firm foundation , a precious cornerstone of the house ; and the believers will not be troubled
I will appoint fairness as a rope , and righteousness as a line of tin : hail will run into the refuge of lies , and great waters will pass through the hiding place .
Your covenant with death will surely be broken , and your covenant with the shadows will not be established . As the whip of the enemy passes , you will be trampled on like waters .
He will take you captive every time he passes , for every morning he passes , and so will it be day and night ; and those who understand the word will be terrified .
The bed was short , so that one could not rest . It was narrow , so that one could not cover himself .
&quot; The Lord will rise like Mount Blythe , and he will be angry like the valley of Gibeon , to do His work , and it will be a great work , and His work will be accomplished , and it will be wondrous .
&quot; You shall not blaspheme at this time , for your bounds are stronger than your bounds ; for I have heard from the Lord of hosts the thing that has been determined , to do destruction on all the earth .
&quot; Listen to my voice , and listen to my words .
Is that land often cultivated for sowing , or is it often reclaimed for raking ?
&quot; Isn &apos;t he who spreads the ground and plants fine anise , and plants fine anise , and plants wheat in ranks , and wheat in places , and wheat in fields ?
for the doctrine of God guided him to work as a farmer , and taught him
They used to beat small anise without sharp instruments , and to roll large anise without whips , but to beat small anise with sticks and to beat large anise with sticks
