&quot; But the people of your enemies will be like dust , and the people of the oppressors will be like flying branches ; and it will come suddenly in a moment .
&quot; The Lord of hosts will avenge Him with thunder , with earthquakes , with loud voices , with swift winds , with violent winds , and with a flame of destruction .
Then the people of the land of Alyel , who are all those who attack Alyel and his shield , and trouble him , will be like a dream , like a night vision .
He will be like a hungry man who eats in a dream , and wakes up and is hungry ; or like a thirsty man who drinks water in a dream , and wakes up and is faint , and desires to drink ; and so will he be against the people of the mountains of Zion .
Behold , you are waiting in wonder , and you are drunken at your feasts , and they are drunken , but not by wine ; and they are distorted eastward and westward , but not by wine
For the Lord will pour out the Spirit of sleep upon you , and seal up your eyes , and cover your heads ; for your eyes are a prophet , and your heads are a prophet .
&quot; You see all the signs as sealed scrolls . He who gave them to the scribes said , &apos; Remember them . &apos; He said , &apos; I cannot remember because they are sealed . &apos; 
