&quot; Because these people are close to me , they respect me with their lips , and their hearts are far from me , and they fear me , and they do not obey the commandment of men , &quot; says the Lord .
&quot; Therefore I will do strange things in this people , strange and strange , and the wisdom of the wise shall be destroyed , and the wisdom of the wise shall be hid .
