The humble man shall rejoice in the Lord ; and the poor among men shall rejoice in the Holy One of Israel .
For the oppressors are made void , and the blasphemers are extinguished ; and all who seek to do iniquity are cut off .
They make the innocent to be guilty in their disputes , they reproach the people at the gates , they lay snares , they use vanity , they defraud the righteous .
