Those who are confused in their hearts will understand , and those who complain will be taught .
&quot; Woe to these rebellious children , &quot; says the Lord , &quot; for they have plotted against me , they have made a covenant , they have not made a covenant with me , they have not made a covenant with me , they have not made a covenant with my Spirit ,
&quot; Go up to Egypt without asking me , and add your strength to Pharaoh &apos;s strength , and cast yourself into the shadow of Egypt
Therefore the strength of Pharaoh will be a shame to you , and it will be a shame to you under the shadow of Egypt .
Their princes are in Zoan , and their envoys are at Hanes .
They shall be ashamed of that which is not profitable to their people , and they shall be ashamed of humiliation , neither help nor benefit .
And they carried their treasures on the backs of the donkeys , and their treasures on the saddles of the camels ; and they went through the land of hardship , the land of lions , and mother lions , and vipers , and flaming dragonflies , to that which was not profitable to their people .
