Thus said the Lord Yahweh , the Holy One of Israel ; &quot; You must be saved for your return to rest , and you must be strengthened for peace and security ; but you refuse
&quot; But you said , &apos; No , we will run on horses ; therefore you will run ; and we will run on fast-moving cattle ; therefore those who chase you will also run fast .
One scourgeth a thousand , and five scourgeth , and ye shall all flee ; so that the remnant is like the pole of the mountain , and like the great flag of the mountain .
The Lord will wait for you , and will give you mercy , and will rise up and have mercy on you ; for the Lord is a just God , and all who wait for Him are blessed .
&quot; The people will dwell in Zion and in Jerusalem . Do not weep . The Lord will give you mercy for your cry , and when He hears , He will listen to you .
For the Lord has given you bread in hardship , and water in distress ; but your teachers will no longer hide , and your eyes will see your teachers .
&quot; You will either turn to the left or to the right , and you will hear a voice behind you saying , &apos; This is the right way , and you will walk in it
