In the days of the great slaughter , and in the days of the collapse of the high places , there shall be rivers flowing through the hills and the valleys .
When the Lord wraps up the wounds of his people , and heals them with whips , the moon will be like the sun , and the sun will be multiplied seven times , like the light of seven days .
Behold , the name of the LORD cometh from afar , and his wrath is kindled , and his smoke is poured out , and his lips are filled with wrath , and his tongue is like a burning fire .
