&quot; Woe to those who seek help in the land of Egypt , who rely on horses , and on many chariots , and on mighty horsemen , but do not look to the Holy One of Israel , nor ask the Lord
&quot; For the Lord is wise ; He will bring down evil , and will not repent of his words , but will rise up against the house of evil , and against the helper of evil .
