Thus saith the LORD unto me ; The lion and the young lion shall roar , and the shepherds shall call upon him , and he shall not be afraid of their voices , nor shall he be weary of their noise ; and the LORD of hosts shall come down to battle in the valley of Zion .
As a bird covers its wings , so the Lord of hosts will protect Jerusalem ; He will protect and save , He will guard over the gates .
&quot; Now , O Israel , you shall return to the Lord , because you have rebelled against the Lord deeply .
