Behold , there shall be a king in righteousness , and a prince in equity .
There will be a man as a refuge from the wind , and as a hiding place from the stormy rain , and as a river in the dry land , and as the shadow of a great rock in the weary land .
A man who can see will not lose his eyes , and a man who can hear will hear .
He will open the hearts of men , He will understand knowledge , He will close the tongues of men , He will speak quickly .
A fool is no longer called a wise man , and a petty man is no longer called a great man
For they speak foolish words , and sin in their hearts , and practice blasphemy , and speak falsehood , and attack the Lord , and make the hungry to have nothing to eat , and the thirsty to have no water to drink
