They will weep for the good land , and for the fruitful vineyards .
The thorns will grow in the land of my people , and in the city of joy , and in all the houses of joy .
For the palace will be abandoned , and the cities of the multitude will be abandoned ; and the towers of the mountains will be a cave , and a pasture for the donkeys of the field , and a pasture for the flock of sheep .
until the Holy Spirit waters us from above , and the wilderness becomes a field , and the field is like a forest
In those days justice shall dwell in the wilderness , and righteousness in the fertile fields .
Peace shall be the fruit of righteousness , and the end of righteousness shall be a steady one for ever .
&quot; My people shall dwell in a peaceful dwelling place , a secure dwelling place , a quiet resting place .
