The sinners in Zion are afraid ; the disobedient are seized . Who among us can live with the fire of destruction ? Who among us can live with the fire of eternity ?
Who doeth righteousness , and speaketh uprightly , and hateth the spoil of oppression , and shaketh not his hand , and receiveth not bribes , and heareth not blood , and keepeth not his eyes from evil deeds .
He shall dwell in high places , and his shield shall be a stronghold of rocks , and his food shall not be lacking , and his water shall not be cut off .
&quot; Your eyes shall see the glory of the king , and shall see the vast land
Then your heart will think of the terrible thing , and say to itself , &quot; Where is the purpose of the counting , and where is the money of Pinggong , and where is the house of the guard ? &quot;
&quot; You will not see the people who are violent . They speak in depth , and you do not understand . They murmur , and you do not understand
