And the angel of the LORD stood by them , and the glory of the LORD was upon them on all sides ; and the shepherds were afraid .
Then the angel said to them , &quot; Do not be afraid , for I give you the glad tidings concerning the people .
For today the Savior , the Lord Christ , was born for you in the city of David
&quot; When you see a child clothed in cloth , lying in a manger , it is a sign .
Suddenly a great army of angels spoke to the angel , praising God
Glory belongs to God in the highest place , and peace belongs to him who rejoices in the earth .
And the angels departed from them , and went up into heaven ; and the shepherds said to one another , &quot; Let us go to Bethlehem , and see what is done , as the Lord has commanded us .
So they hurried , and found Mary and Joseph , and the child laying in the chariot
And when they had seen it , they sent forth the word of the angel concerning the child
And whosoever heard it was astonished at what the shepherds said unto them
But Mary had all these things in her heart , and reversed them
And the shepherds returned , and glorified God , and praised Him , for all that they had heard and seen , as the angel had said to them .
And when he was eight days old , he circumcised the child , and called with him Jesus , which was the name of the angel before he was conceived .
&quot; When the days of purification were fulfilled according to the Law of Moses , they took the child to Jerusalem , and offered him to the Lord
