Then he took him by the hand on the west side , and blessed God ,
&quot; Now , O Lord , as You have spoken , let your servant die safely .
For your salvation has been seen in my eyes
&quot; This is what you have prepared before the people .
&quot; It is the light of the Gentiles , and the glory of your people Israel .
And the parents of the children marveled at the words of Jesus
