Blessed is he who does not fall because of me
And when the messengers of John were gone , Jesus spoke to the people concerning John , saying , &quot; What have you been going out to see in the wilderness , and the reed that is blown by the wind ?
What is it that ye go out to see , a man clothed in fine linen ? and a man that feasts in fine linen is in the king &apos;s palace
What is it that you go out to see , the prophet ? I tell you , he is more than the prophet
And it is written , &quot; I will send my messenger before you , and I will prepare the way . &quot; And that is the man
&quot; I tell you , there is not a woman born greater than John , but the least in the kingdom of God is greater than he .
The people and the tax collectors , having been baptized by John , when they heard this , were justified by God
